---
---

<section id="origin" class="py-24 bg-[#0d0b09] relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">

      <!-- Text Content Side -->
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-[#c5a059] font-medium block">
          Turrialba Volcanic Slopes • Costa Rica
        </span>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-5xl text-white font-bold tracking-tight leading-tight">
          Where Volcanic Ash & Misty Forests Create <span class="gold-gradient-text italic font-normal">Pure Elixir</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm sm:text-base font-light leading-relaxed">
          High above the clouds, on the rich, mineral-laden slopes of the active Turrialba Volcano, lies Coffee Secret. Here, warm Caribbean air currents collide with cool mountain winds, nurturing coffee cherries through long, gradual maturation cycles.
        </p>

        <!-- Feature Points -->
        <div class="space-y-4 pt-4 border-t border-white/10">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#15120e] border border-[#d4af37]/40 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-[#d4af37]">
              🌋
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-serif text-lg text-white font-semibold">Volcanic Soil Chemistry</h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-1">Rich in potassium, phosphorus, and organic minerals, infusing cherries with intense floral notes and bright acidity.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#15120e] border border-[#d4af37]/40 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-[#d4af37]">
              🌧️
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-serif text-lg text-white font-semibold">Unique Microclimate</h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-1">Year-round mist, steady rainfall, and drastic night-to-day temperature drops compress rich sugars inside the bean.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#15120e] border border-[#d4af37]/40 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-[#d4af37]">
              🌿
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-serif text-lg text-white font-semibold">Selective Hand Harvesting</h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-1">Only 100% ripe red cherries at peak Brix sugar levels are handpicked by master harvesters across 3 passes.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-6">
          <a
            href="#timeline"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] font-bold text-[#d4af37] hover:text-white transition-colors"
          >
            <span>Explore The Seed-to-Cup Journey</span>
            <span>&rarr;</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Imagery Side -->
      <div class="relative">
        <!-- Main Image -->
        <div class="relative z-10 rounded-sm overflow-hidden border border-[#d4af37]/30 shadow-[0_10px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.8)]">
          <img
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1511537190424-bbbab87ac5eb?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop"
            alt="Coffee Plantation in Turrialba Volcano Costa Rica"
            loading="lazy"
            class="w-full h-[480px] object-cover hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700 filter brightness-95"
          />
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#0d0b09] via-transparent to-transparent"></div>

          <!-- Image Floating Tag -->
          <div class="absolute bottom-6 left-6 right-6 p-4 rounded-sm bg-[#15120e]/90 border border-[#d4af37]/30 backdrop-blur-md">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <div>
                <p class="font-serif text-sm text-white font-semibold">Secret Estate • Sector Santa Cruz</p>
                <p class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-[#c5a059]">GPS: 10.0247° N, 83.7656° W</p>
              </div>
              <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-[#d4af37]/20 border border-[#d4af37] text-[#f3e5ab] text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest font-bold rounded-xs">
                Micro-lot
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Decorative Floating Accent Box -->
        <div class="absolute -top-6 -left-6 w-32 h-32 border border-[#d4af37]/30 z-0 hidden sm:block"></div>
        <div class="absolute -bottom-6 -right-6 w-32 h-32 border border-[#d4af37]/30 z-0 hidden sm:block"></div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
